                    <div style="background:rgba(21,128,61,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(63,185,80,0.25); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 16px; margin:0 24px 16px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text); line-height:1.5;">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:16px; vertical-align:middle; color:var(--green);">lock</span> <strong>Privacy & Security Enforcement:</strong> All broker account numbers are strictly masked to the last 4 digits (e.g. <code>***3261</code>). Personal names, tax IDs, routing numbers, and OAuth access tokens are never persisted in the cache table.
